#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ProblemSetDetail.pm:308
msgid ""
"A student might start a timed test close to the close date.  This setting "
"allows to either cut them off at the close date or allow them the full time "
